<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net sellers of French bonds in Oct.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net sellers of French bonds in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released on Friday by the finance ministry showed non-resident investors sold a net 10.6 billion francs of French government bonds in October.</p>
<p>Non-residents were net buyers of government bonds (OATs, BTANs) in September for the first time since November 1995.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			     Oct	Sep   Oct 95</p>
<p>  - Direct investment			  6.80     0.41    9.86</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad	   -1.37    -6.93   -2.15</p>
<p>     - Foreign investment in France	8.16     7.34   12.01</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT			 -9.28   -26.79  -11.87</p>
<p>  - Residents in foreign securities	1.51   -20.69    6.54</p>
<p>     - shares				   -4.11    -7.71    1.03</p>
<p>     - bonds				    -8.11   -23.97   -0.94</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	   13.62    10.16    6.06</p>
<p>     - derivative products		   0.10     0.83    0.40</p>
<p>  - Non-residents in French securities -10.78    -6.10  -18.41</p>
<p>     - shares				    4.98     0.42    0.74</p>
<p>     - bonds				   -11.53     1.75  -23.18</p>
<p>	  -Govt securities (OATs, BTANs) -10.56     1.89  -32.08</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	   -4.24    -8.27    4.03</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			   -13.65    14.60    0.43</p>
<p>  - Credits				     35.29   -40.79  -17.13</p>
<p>  - Liabilities				-48.94    55.39   17.57</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS				 -0.42     0.01    0.15</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		   -16.55   -11.77   -1.43</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
